 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Two things at once, or one that interrupts the other",
     "texto": [
      "**Đang A thì B** = you were doing A when (suddenly) B happened: «Tôi **đang** ngủ **thì** điện thoại reo» = I was sleeping when the phone rang.",
      "**Vừa A thì B** = no sooner had I done A than B happened: «Tôi **vừa** đến sân bay **thì** trời mưa» = No sooner had I got to the airport than it started to rain.",
      "**Trong khi** A, B = while A, B (at the same time, often with contrast): «**Trong khi** tôi xếp hàng, vợ tôi đi đổi tiền» = While I was queuing, my wife went to change money.",
      "**Sau khi** A, B = after A, B. **Trước khi** A, B = before A, B. After both comes a whole sentence, with no change."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
